{
  "_comment": "One entry per series. Add a line here and the pipeline, SQL views, narrative and page pick it up. 'good_when' tells the narrative how to word a move: 'down' = a fall is favourable, 'up' = a rise is favourable, null = neutral. 'scale' multiplies the source value before it is stored in monthly_values (EVDS publishes trade in USD thousand). reports/pipeline_status.md records what each code returned on the last run.",
